{"duration": 28.99, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.62, "text": "Orcas in other oceans have learned\nthe same hunt. In the Gulf of"}, {"start": 3.62, "end": 8.26, "text": "California, a group known as\nMoctezuma's pod was filmed killing young"}, {"start": 8.26, "end": 14.64, "text": "great whites in August 2020, and\nagain in August 2022. Those orcas"}, {"start": 14.64, "end": 17.89, "text": "push a shark to the surface\nand roll it onto its back."}, {"start": 18.59, "end": 25.65, "text": "A shark held upside down goes limp,\na state called tonic immobility."}, {"start": 25.65, "end": 28.99, "text": "While it lies still, the\norcas take the liver."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.4, "text": "Orcas"}, {"start": 0.4, "end": 0.56, "text": "in"}, {"start": 0.56, "end": 0.86, "text": "other"}, {"start": 0.86, "end": 1.32, "text": "oceans"}, {"start": 1.32, "end": 1.58, "text": "have"}, {"start": 1.58, "end": 1.82, "text": "learned"}, {"start": 1.82, "end": 2.02, "text": "the"}, {"start": 2.02, "end": 2.28, "text": "same"}, {"start": 2.28, "end": 2.6, "text": "hunt."}, {"start": 3.06, "end": 3.1, "text": "In"}, {"start": 3.1, "end": 3.24, "text": "the"}, {"start": 3.24, "end": 3.42, "text": "Gulf"}, {"start": 3.42, "end": 3.62, "text": "of"}, {"start": 3.62, "end": 4.2, "text": "California,"}, {"start": 4.74, "end": 4.78, "text": "a"}, {"start": 4.78, "end": 5.02, "text": "group"}, {"start": 5.02, "end": 5.26, "text": "known"}, {"start": 5.26, "end": 5.48, "text": "as"}, {"start": 5.48, "end": 6.26, "text": "Moctezuma's"}, {"start": 6.26, "end": 6.52, "text": "pod"}, {"start": 6.52, "end": 7.12, "text": "was"}, {"start": 7.12, "end": 7.48, "text": "filmed"}, {"start": 7.48, "end": 7.96, "text": "killing"}, {"start": 7.96, "end": 8.26, "text": "young"}, {"start": 8.26, "end": 8.56, "text": "great"}, {"start": 8.56, "end": 8.88, "text": "whites"}, {"start": 8.88, "end": 9.2, "text": "in"}, {"start": 9.2, "end": 9.52, "text": "August"}, {"start": 9.52, "end": 10.2, "te